  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 10,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Trazas distribuidas\n\nBuscador Tempo debajo. Clickeá una fila para ver el waterfall completo **web → booking-service → events-service**. Desde cualquier span, el botón *\"Logs for this span\"* salta a Loki correlacionado por `trace_id`.\n\n> Filtrá por servicio con la variable **$service** arriba a la izquierda. Para búsquedas más ricas (por duración, atributos, TraceQL), usá **Explore → Tempo** (link arriba a la derecha)."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Trazas encontradas",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 22,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "id": 11,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "${DS_TEMPO}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "${DS_TEMPO}"
          },
          "queryType": "traceqlSearch",
          "filters": [
            {
              "id": "service-name",
              "tag": "service.name",
              "operator": "=",
              "scope": "resource",
              "value": [
                "$service"
              ],
              "valueType": "string"
            }
          ],
          "limit": 50,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "inspect": false
          },
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Ver traza",
              "url": "/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22queries%22%3A%5B%7B%22refId%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22datasource%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22uid%22%3A%22tempo%22%7D%2C%22queryType%22%3A%22traceql%22%2C%22query%22%3A%22${__data.fields.traceID}%22%7D%5D%7D",
              "targetBlank": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "10s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": [
    "tickets",
    "traces"
  ],
